]

where:

* (W_i): hydration and solvent organization;
* (I_i): ionic composition and gradients;
* (L_i): lipid membranes and compartmental boundaries;
* (P_i): proteins, channels, receptors and enzymes;
* (C_i): cytoskeletal organization;
* (E_i): extracellular matrix;
* (M_i): metabolic and energetic state.

The revised bearer is:

[
\boxed{
A_i=
\langle
\mathcal M_i,\Phi_i,H_i,\mathcal K_i,\Sigma_i
\rangle.
}
]

The subject is neither:

[
A_i^{\mathrm{abstract}}
]

nor:

[
\Sigma_i^{\mathrm{inventory}}.
]

It is the organized activity enacted through that regime:

[
\boxed{
D_i
\equiv_{\mathrm{int}}
A_i[\Sigma_i].
